{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15205150","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15205150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1520515001:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>か、ここに何の用だ？","source_cn":"你。<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x07A5EFAC9BF2E273","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>か、ここに何の用だ？","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>か、ここに何の用だ？","variant_male_record_index":"186510","variant_female_record_index":"186511","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520515002:0":{"text":"ゴーダンさま、戦士たちの遺体の埋葬について――","source_cn":"戈丹，战士的遗体需要妥善安葬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD3D76BFAFC9CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520515003:0":{"text":"魔法協会からご提案が……","source_cn":"魔法师协会想出了一些办法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34E3B04ACF2E1278","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:6:1520515004:0":{"text":"ヤクボルの死者を埋葬する旨と、モルガンの解決策をゴーダンに伝えた……","source_cn":"将安葬雅库伯尔战士的事宜，以及摩根的解决方案告诉了戈丹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CF774757EE30C1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520515005:1":{"text":"無理な話だ。樹木葬以外はあり得ん！","source_cn":"雅库伯尔必须使用树葬。没得商量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC13F0816F7345827","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520515006:1":{"text":"……またかよ。","source_cn":"……又来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BAF0DF179D2C865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1520515006":{"text":"……またかよ。","source_cn":"……又来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BAF0DF179D2C865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520515007:1":{"text":"樹木葬は、死者の家族と祭官が共に一本の木、または土地を一カ所指定し……","source_cn":"树葬的流程是：逝者死去后，由亲属与巫祭们共同指定一棵树...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4D4433E030D61D58","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"樹木葬は、死者の家族と祭官が共に一本の木、または土地を一カ所指定し……","female":"樹木葬は、死者の家族と祭官が共に一本の木、または土地を一カ所指定し……","variant_male_record_index":"186517","variant_female_record_index":"186518","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520515008:0":{"text":"遺体を木の下に埋めるか、埋葬した遺体の上に木の種を植えます。","source_cn":"将尸体埋入树下，或在埋葬尸体时放上一颗树种。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF5C30969492B7537","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"遺体を木の下に埋めるか、埋葬した遺体の上に木の種を植えます。","female":"遺体を木の下に埋めるか、埋葬した遺体の上に木の種を植えます。","variant_male_record_index":"186519","variant_female_record_index":"186520","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1520515009:0":{"text":"そうすることで、死者は森の一部となり、風が葉を揺らすことで、わたしたちに語りかけるのです。","source_cn":"最后，逝者会成为丛林的一部分。风吹过树叶时，他们就在对...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF3D4D9CE0DA28DA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"そうすることで、死者は森の一部となり、風が葉を揺らすことで、わたしたちに語りかけるのです。","female":"そうすることで、死者は森の一部となり、風が葉を揺らすことで、わたしたちに語りかけるのです。","variant_male_record_index":"186521","variant_female_record_index":"186522","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1520515010:0":{"text":"それから、狩猟神の神殿の前で、戦士たちのために儀式を行う。","source_cn":"此外，还要在狩猎神的神殿前为战士们举行一次祭祀仪式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7555D4CC74E55D8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520515011:0":{"text":"これによって、死んだ同胞の魂を慰め、神の御許へと帰すのだ。","source_cn":"以此来告慰死去的族人，让他们的魂灵能够回归神明的怀抱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAEB0D61BEFF1E6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1520515012:0":{"text":"まあ……我らが信仰する神はもういないがな。","source_cn":"但是……哼，雅库伯尔信仰的神明已经不在了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBD3CA2C1C11B031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1520515012":{"text":"まあ……我らが信仰する神はもういないがな。","source_cn":"但是……哼，雅库伯尔信仰的神明已经不在了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBD3CA2C1C11B031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1520515013:0":{"text":"……儀式は通常通り執り行う。","source_cn":"无论如何，祭祀仪式必须保留。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43822DB01554EA8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1520515014:0":{"text":"本来なら、狩猟神より賜った神器で死者の最後の言葉を家族に伝えるのだが、神がいなくなった今、神器はもう使えん。","source_cn":"狩猎神曾赐下神器，能将雅库伯尔死者最后的话语传递给亲人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA273F7597DA72070","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1520515015:0":{"text":"だが、あの儀式は死者だけでなく、残された者が最後の別れをする場でもあるのだ。","source_cn":"但是那仪式不仅是为了死去的战士，也是为了还活着的人。他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED84B3286A96CBDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1520515016:0":{"text":"樹木葬と儀式を行う人手は足りているのですか？","source_cn":"树葬和仪式的人手？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE78E2FD7B450779","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1520515017:0":{"text":"……いや。祭官の大半が戦死したからな。","source_cn":"没有。大部分祭司都牺牲了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x637C80B54B689AF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1520515018:0":{"text":"簡潔明瞭で助かるよ。","source_cn":"简单直接，我喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A0F0F90D70E88DB","variant_s